; fixtures/import/sort/crlf.journal
;
; Every terminator in this file is CRLF, including the blank lines. A sort that
; normalises one line ending shows the whole file as changed in the user's diff.

account assets:bank:checking
account expenses:groceries
commodity $1,000.00

